# A block deleted in one pane comes back in both panes when undone from the other pane.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
Work:
	- Report
END
keys <C-w> s <C-w> h dd
hide Errands:
keys g2 z
see │▌ Errands:
see   Errands:                                       │
quit
saved <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
Work:
	- Report
END
